      "id": "ferry.kettle.choose",
      "speaker": "ferry-cook",
      "historicalLabel": "fictional-world",
      "text": "“A single heat frees my hands for the bench. A pot for two can catch the early boat. I can keep six measures on the tally either way. Set the place that suits what you want these people to have.”",
